      "contract": "graph-math-step/v2",
      "display_unit": "classify",
      "explanation": "$$\\begin{gathered}a=0\\\\f\\!\\left(x\\right)=-2x+3\\\\\\text{斜率}\\ -2<0,\\ \\text{严格递减}\\Rightarrow a=0\\ \\text{成立}\\end{gathered}$$\n\n$$\\begin{gathered}a>0:\\ \\text{开口向上，对称轴}\\ x=\\frac{1}{a}\\\\\\text{严格递减的部分}:\\ x\\le \\frac{1}{a}\\\\\\left[2, +\\infty\\right)\\not\\subseteq \\left\\{x\\mid x\\le \\frac{1}{a}\\right\\}\\Rightarrow a>0\\ \\text{舍去}\\end{gathered}$$\n\n$$\\begin{gathered}a<0:\\ \\text{开口向下，对称轴}\\ x=\\frac{1}{a}\\\\\\text{严格递减的部分}:\\ x\\ge \\frac{1}{a}\\\\a<0\\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{a}\\in \\left(-\\infty, 0\\right)\\\\\\frac{1}{a}\\le 2\\ \\text{恒成立}\\Rightarrow a\\in \\left(-\\infty, 0\\right)\\end{gathered}$$",
      "highlight": {
        "caption": "按二次项系数分类",
        "connector": "⇒",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "代入后的函数",
            "math": "\\begin{gathered}a=0\\\\f\\!\\left(x\\right)=-2x+3\\end{gathered}"
          },
          {
            "label": "本类结论",
            "math": "\\text{斜率}\\ -2<0,\\ \\text{严格递减}\\Rightarrow a=0\\ \\text{成立}"
          }
        ],
